              },
              {
                "name": "itemId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Deletes the item from the cart.\n\nThe Cart ID from the [Create cart](/v3/cart-and-checkout/api-reference/carts-v3/carts/carts) endpoint is used in the path parameter.\n\nThe Item ID from the [Create item](/v3/cart-and-checkout/api-reference/carts-v3/items/items) endpoint is used in the path parameter.\n"
